C# bridge (vendor/modmixer-bridge)
----------------------------------
The ModMixer Bridge is a small RimWorld mod that streams diagnostics over
localhost TCP. It links against:

  * Lib.Harmony 2.3.3 — MIT License
      https://github.com/pardeike/Harmony
  * RimWorld game assemblies (Assembly-CSharp, UnityEngine, etc.)
      Referenced at compile time only; not redistributed.

